    "message": "Add calibrated shared photon pairs and cached sampling plans\n\nRestore fixed-total pair statistics and compare complete PNR and click laws using fresh 5M records per method. Preserve finite-design infeasibility, higher-order counterexamples and explicit rolling-merge failures.\n\nPublish 66 isolated setup-inclusive timing panels with CPU and GPU Frugal. Include integer alias audits and input-only click ordering; no universal or equal-quality claim.\n\nValidation: 3507 independent checks; 940 tests run, 911 passed, zero failures/errors; thirteen new tests.",
